WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.321 --> 00:00:02.880
- 90% of the clothes
they're not gonna fit.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.151
- My small frame is not
what stores think of.

00:00:06.151 --> 00:00:07.451
- Do you have a size 15?

00:00:07.451 --> 00:00:08.859
And they'll be like no.

00:00:08.859 --> 00:00:10.499
Scaring away normal customers.

00:00:10.499 --> 00:00:12.247
- Dialing on what actually fits you

00:00:12.247 --> 00:00:14.908
is more important than
just getting something

00:00:14.908 --> 00:00:16.818
that gives you the look.

00:00:16.818 --> 00:00:18.321
- I actually try my best to go to stores

00:00:18.321 --> 00:00:20.007
that have extra smalls available

00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:21.877
because those usually fit me very well.

00:00:21.877 --> 00:00:23.279
I think I feel the most conscience

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:24.376
of myself at formal events

00:00:24.376 --> 00:00:26.204
because formal events involve blazers.

00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:29.272
Especialy shoulders don't
quite sit right on my body

00:00:29.272 --> 00:00:30.938
and anything that goes past my waist

00:00:30.938 --> 00:00:32.564
will make me look shorter
than I already am.

00:00:32.564 --> 00:00:34.575
- The one physical characteristic

00:00:34.575 --> 00:00:35.530
that people will come up to you

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.480
and just like throw in
your face about you.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.781
Boy, are you tall!

00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:40.955
Most stores don't have anything for me

00:00:40.955 --> 00:00:42.438
so my go to clothing is usually

00:00:42.438 --> 00:00:44.185
like solid colored t shirts.

00:00:44.185 --> 00:00:45.954
Like I need a very long t shirt

00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:48.310
but that usually makes it wider.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:49.407
I just sort of gave up.

00:00:49.407 --> 00:00:50.220
- As a bigger dude

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.007
I'm totally comfortable
with the size of my body

00:00:52.007 --> 00:00:53.978
but you don't want to look unflattering.

00:00:53.978 --> 00:00:55.055
Plain and simple.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.062
Typically I wear like
my pants a little higher

00:00:58.062 --> 00:01:00.094
just to kind of flatten out the stomach

00:01:00.094 --> 00:01:03.121
and if I can't find clothes
that don't look good on me

00:01:03.121 --> 00:01:05.173
then it makes me really
not want to go shopping.

00:01:05.173 --> 00:01:06.860
I think this is going to be super fun.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:08.444
I'm gonna get mansformed today.

00:01:08.444 --> 00:01:10.435
- What would you consider
an area of opportunity

00:01:10.435 --> 00:01:11.817
in your wardrobe?

00:01:11.817 --> 00:01:13.219
- Opportunity.

00:01:13.219 --> 00:01:14.743
There's a lot of real estate.

00:01:14.743 --> 00:01:18.034
- I wanna accentuate the
rights areas of my torso.

00:01:18.034 --> 00:01:19.761
- For me, part of looking sharp

00:01:19.761 --> 00:01:21.102
is to have form fitting stuff.

00:01:21.102 --> 00:01:22.382
- One of my concerns

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:23.947
when I am wearing tighter fitting clothing

00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:25.003
is mobility.

00:01:25.003 --> 00:01:26.567
- I don't even wear these
shoes all that often

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:28.030
cause they've got laces.

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:29.981
Like my feet are so far away from my head.

00:01:29.981 --> 00:01:32.216
- You actually have a greater closet

00:01:32.216 --> 00:01:34.044
if you remove things that are either

00:01:34.044 --> 00:01:36.929
eye sores that you
don't gravitate towards,

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.534
things that are ill-fitting,

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:41.440
or things that are
pretty old and tattered.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.415
- Yeah.

00:01:42.415 --> 00:01:44.995
These jeans have a big hole in them.

00:01:44.995 --> 00:01:47.210
- We all have different body shapes.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.790
And I wanted to let the guys know today

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.513
is that what you feel is your insecurity

00:01:52.513 --> 00:01:54.646
